@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Manulife (Vietnam): rules and terms of the group universal-linked product with flexible
-- premiums (MoF letter 14548/BTC-QLBH, 27 October 2017). Row VN-14.
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/manulife-group-linked.txt, the pdftotext (reading order) rendering
-- of the insurer's PDF, 1536 lines. `src:N` is line N of that file; every `— src:N |` line
-- below was generated by tools/vnsrc.py, never typed.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER. Days are calendar days unless a name says
-- otherwise (NOTES.md, fork F3). Dates are DATEs built with YMD.
--
-- Membership test: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact (an HR officer,
-- a beneficiary, the insurer's own records clerk), or a document of the Contract records it.
-- Whether the fact makes anything payable is a rule, and lives in the Article's module.

§ `Nouns for the group universal-linked flexible-premium product`

§§ `The parties and the other persons the document names`

-- 1.1 the Company; 1.2 the Policyholder; 1.4 the Insured Member; 1.6 the Beneficiary.
-- src:22 | Công Ty: là Công Ty Trách Nhiệm Hữu Hạn Manulife
-- src:25 | Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm: là (i) tổ chức được thành lập hợp
-- src:37 | Người Được Bảo Hiểm: là người mà tính mạng và/
-- src:52-53 | Người Thụ Hưởng: là (các) cá nhân hoặc tổ chức được…
-- 9.3 the legal heirs; 26.1 the person claiming; 29.2(b) the New Organisation.
-- src:521 | Thụ Hưởng sẽ được chi trả cho người thừa kế hợp pháp
-- src:1364-1365 | chứng, chứng từ liên quan phải được người yêu cầu giải…
-- src:1483-1484 | nhập, hợp nhất với Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm (“Tổ Chức…
-- A GROUP product: the Policyholder is an organisation (1.2), the Insured Members are the
-- persons covered, each with a certificate of their own (1.11), and each Insured Member,
-- not the Policyholder, names the Beneficiary in the Enrolment Form (1.6, 9.1).
DECLARE `A party` IS ONE OF
    `the Company`
    `the Policyholder`
    `the Insured Member`
    `the Beneficiary`
    `the legal heirs of the Insured Member`
    `the claimant`
    `the New Organisation`

§§ `The documents of the Contract`

-- 2.1: the Contract consists of eight kinds of document.
-- src:239-250 | đồng bảo hiểm (“Hợp Đồng”). Hợp Đồng bao gồm các…
DECLARE `A document of the Contract` IS ONE OF
    `the Application`                                    -- (i) 2.2
    `the List of Insured Members`                        -- (ii) 1.3
    `an Enrolment Form`                                  -- (iii) 1.5
    `the Contract Page`                                  -- (iv)
    `a Certificate of Insurance`                         -- (v) 1.11
    `the approved rules and terms of the main and rider products` -- (vi)
    `an Endorsement`                                     -- (vii)
    `a written amendment or supplement to the Contract`  -- (viii)

§§ `Article 1.26 — the Plan`

-- src:223-227 | 1.26 Kế Hoạch Bảo Hiểm: là Kế Hoạch Bảo Hiểm Cơ Bản…
DECLARE `A Plan` IS ONE OF
    `the Basic Plan`
    `the Enhanced Plan`

§§ `Article 1.2 — the Policyholder`

-- src:25-31 | Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm: là (i) tổ chức được thành lập hợp…
DECLARE `The Policyholder's particulars` HAS
    `an organisation lawfully established in Vietnam`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `established for the sole purpose of buying insurance`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `declared and signed the Application`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `recorded as Policyholder on the Contract Page, a Certificate or an Endorsement` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 1.4 — the person to be insured, as at a date`

-- The facts 1.4 tests "at the time of the request for insurance" (src:41), and that 11.2,
-- 28.4 and 29.3 test later. `as at` is the date the record describes.
-- src:37-47 | Người Được Bảo Hiểm: là người mà tính mạng và/…
-- 11.2(a): conversion to an individual policy needs residence and full civil capacity.
-- src:632-634 | • Người Được Bảo Hiểm cư trú tại Việt Nam và có…
-- 29.3(a): years of employment with the Policyholder. NOTHING where there is no employment
-- relationship (1.4 does not require one; NOTES.md fork F27).
-- src:1518-1521 | a) Tại thời điểm chấm dứt Hợp Đồng, nếu Người Được…
DECLARE `The person's particulars` HAS
    `as at`                                              IS A DATE
    `date of birth`                                      IS A DATE
    `recorded in the List of Insured Members`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `present in Vietnam`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a valid Enrolment Form`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium for this person paid to the Company`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `resident in Vietnam`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `of full civil capacity under the Civil Code`        IS A BOOLEAN
    `full years of employment with the Policyholder`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER

§§ `Articles 1.22 and 1.25 — the accounts of an Insured Member's part`

-- 1.22: the Account Value is the sum of the Policyholder's and the Insured Member's account
-- values; 1.25: the Vested Account Value is the part of the Policyholder's account value that
-- the Policyholder has vested in the Insured Member, at a ratio the Contract Page or the
-- Certificate records (src:221-222). The ratio is an input; NOTES.md fork F10.
-- src:203-211 | Giá Trị Tài Khoản: là tổng (i) Giá Trị Tài Khoản Của Bên…
-- src:216-222 | Giá Trị Tài Khoản Đã Trao Quyền Cho Người Được…
DECLARE `The accounts` HAS
    `the Policyholder's account value`   IS A NUMBER
    `the Insured Member's account value` IS A NUMBER
    `the vesting ratio`                  IS A NUMBER

§§ `The state of an Insured Member's part of the Contract`

-- In force (including the grace period, 18.1 last sentence), in its grace period, lapsed
-- (18.2), suspended (Article 20), or terminated (Article 28). The Company's records state it.
-- src:1006-1007 | Trong thời gian gia hạn đóng phí bảo hiểm, phần Hợp…
-- src:1023-1026 | Trong thời gian phần Hợp Đồng của Người Được Bảo…
DECLARE `A state of the part` IS ONE OF
    `in force`
    `in force, in the grace period`
    `lapsed`
    `suspended`
    `terminated`

§§ `An Insured Member's part of the Contract`

-- 1.9.4 the Coverage Start Date; 1.9.9 the Maturity Date; 1.7 the Sum Insured; 1.21 Debt.
-- src:86-91 | 1.9.4 Ngày Bắt Đầu Bảo Hiểm: là ngày mà một cá…
-- src:113-118 | 1.9.9 Ngày Đáo Hạn: là ngày kết thúc Thời Hạn Bảo…
-- src:65-68 | Số Tiền Bảo Hiểm: là số tiền được Công Ty chấp nhận…
-- src:195-202 | Nợ: là bất kỳ khoản phí, phí bảo hiểm hoặc khoản tiền…
-- `sum insured at the coverage start date` is what 14.1(d) compares the current one with.
-- `latest reinstatement date` is NOTHING where the part has never been reinstated (19).
DECLARE `An Insured Member's part` HAS
    `coverage start date`                    IS A DATE
    `maturity date`                          IS A DATE
    `latest reinstatement date`              IS A MAYBE DATE
    `plan`                                   IS A `A Plan`
    `sum insured`                            IS A NUMBER
    `sum insured at the coverage start date` IS A NUMBER
    `accounts`                               IS A `The accounts`
    `debt`                                   IS A NUMBER
    `state`                                  IS A `A state of the part`

§§ `Article 3 — a death during the temporary cover period`

-- 3.1: the period runs from the Company's stamp confirming receipt of a complete valid
-- application AND of the full first premium, to the Contract Issue Date or the date the
-- Company issues a postponement or a decline. The facts are dates the stamp and the letters
-- carry. `date the temporary cover period ended` is NOTHING while none of those has happened.
-- src:290-295 | Thời hạn bảo hiểm tạm thời là khoảng thời gian được…
-- 3.1, the definition of Accident (Tai Nạn): four elements a witness can speak to.
-- src:296-302 | Tai Nạn là một sự kiện hoặc một chuỗi sự kiện liên tục,…
-- 3.3: the three causes that defeat the temporary benefit.
-- src:312-319 | rủi ro bảo hiểm nếu Người Được Bảo Hiểm tử vong do…
DECLARE `A death during temporary cover` HAS
    `cover applied for under the main product`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the Company stamped receipt of the complete valid application`      IS A DATE
    `date the Company received the full first premium`                         IS A DATE
    `date the temporary cover period ended`                                    IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date of death`                                                            IS A DATE
    `date of the event that led to death`                                      IS A DATE
    `an event or continuous chain of events, objective in nature`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `caused by a sudden external force or object acting on the body`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the direct and sole cause of death, unrelated to any other cause`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `suicide, whether sane or insane`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `a criminal act of the Insured Member, the Policyholder or a Beneficiary`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `would be accepted at the standard rate on the declared information`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `total sum insured of the main product on all pending applications for this person` IS A NUMBER
    `total premium paid on all pending applications`                           IS A NUMBER
    `medical and underwriting costs the Company paid`                          IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `The outcome under Article 3` IS ONE OF
    `the temporary benefit, with no refund of premium, of` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `a refund of the premium paid, without interest, of`   HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `no temporary benefit is payable`

§§ `Articles 4 to 7 — information, disclosure and misstatement`

-- 4.1: the Company's duty to inform; if it gives false information to conclude the Contract
-- the Policyholder may terminate and recover all premium paid less withdrawals and Debt.
-- src:333-337 | Hiểm. Trong trường hợp Công Ty cung cấp thông tin sai…
DECLARE `A refund under Article 4.1` HAS
    `total premium paid`         IS A NUMBER
    `account value withdrawals`  IS A NUMBER
    `debt`                       IS A NUMBER

-- 4.2: personal information may be transferred to a third party only in the listed cases.
-- src:338-340 | Công Ty không được chuyển giao thông tin cá nhân do…
DECLARE `A transfer of personal information` HAS
    `at the request of a competent state authority`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `for a purpose listed in 4.2(a)`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `consented to in writing by the Policyholder or the Insured Member`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person was told the purpose and given the choice to consent or not`          IS A BOOLEAN

-- 5.1-5.3 and 7: a breach of the duty to declare truthfully, and what the Company's
-- underwriting rules say it would have done had it known. Those rules are not in the
-- document, so what they would have produced is a fact supplied from the underwriting file.
-- src:376-381 | Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm và/hoặc Người Được Bảo Hiểm có…
-- src:385-391 | Công Ty sẽ đơn phương chấm dứt hoặc không chấp nhận…
-- src:403-408 | Trong trường hợp Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm và/hoặc Người…
-- src:487-492 | Điều khoản 7.1 này sẽ không áp dụng trong trường hợp…
DECLARE `A breach of the duty to declare` HAS
    `deliberate`                                                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Company would not have accepted the risk had it known`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Company would have accepted only at a higher premium had it known` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it affected the decision to accept or to reinstate`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `an inaccurate or omitted declaration of age or gender only`            IS A BOOLEAN

-- 5.2: what the refund on termination for deliberate non-disclosure is computed from.
-- src:391-398 | hiểm. Trong trường hợp này Công Ty sẽ không giải quyết…
DECLARE `A refund under Article 5.2` HAS
    `accounts`                 IS A `The accounts`
    `termination charge`       IS A NUMBER
    `debt`                     IS A NUMBER
    `benefits already paid`    IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `The consequence under Article 5` IS ONE OF
    `the part is terminated, and the Net Cash Value less benefits paid is refunded:` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `benefits remain payable; the Company may charge more premium or reduce the Sum Insured`

-- 6.2 and 10.2: the true age falls outside 1.4, or the Company stops cover after a change of
-- particulars. What was paid into and out of the part, at the Company's notice.
-- src:428-440 | Nếu Tuổi thực của Người Được Bảo Hiểm không nằm…
-- src:566-572 | hợp phải ngừng việc bảo hiểm của Người Được Bảo Hiểm…
DECLARE `The money in a part at the Company's notice` HAS
    `date of birth as declared`                                IS A DATE
    `true date of birth`                                       IS A DATE
    `coverage start date`                                      IS A DATE
    `account value at the Company's notice`                    IS A NUMBER
    `premium paid for the part`                                IS A NUMBER
    `premium paid by the Insured Member`                       IS A NUMBER
    `premium paid by the Policyholder`                         IS A NUMBER
    `benefits paid`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `withdrawals from the Insured Member's account value`      IS A NUMBER
    `debt`                                                     IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable underwriting costs`                            IS A NUMBER
    `accounts`                                                 IS A `The accounts`

-- 6.2(a)/(b) and the other Articles that split a payment between the two account holders.
DECLARE `A split between the Policyholder and the Insured Member` HAS
    `to the Policyholder`     IS A NUMBER
    `to the Insured Member`   IS A NUMBER

§§ `Article 9 — the Beneficiaries`

-- src:502-504 | Mỗi Người Được Bảo Hiểm có thể chỉ định Người Thụ…
-- src:517-534 | Nếu không có Người Thụ Hưởng nào được chỉ định…
-- `specified share` is NOTHING where neither the Contract nor the designation fixes one.
-- `survived the Insured Member` is FALSE where the Beneficiary died (a person) or ceased to
-- operate (an organisation) before the Insured Member died; `died at the same moment` covers
-- the case 9.3 does not name (NOTES.md finding X14).
DECLARE `A Beneficiary designation` HAS
    `name`                     IS A STRING
    `specified share`          IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `survived the Insured Member` IS A BOOLEAN
    `died at the same moment as the Insured Member` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A share of the death proceeds` HAS
    `payee`  IS A STRING
    `share`  IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `Who receives the death proceeds` IS ONE OF
    `the legal heirs of the Insured Member, in full`
    `the Beneficiaries, in these shares` HAS `the shares` IS A LIST OF `A share of the death proceeds`

-- 9.1: the funeral benefit (12.1) and the death benefit (12.2) go to the Beneficiary; "other
-- benefits" to the Policyholder and/or the Insured Member as each benefit provides.
-- src:504-510 | và tự chịu trách nhiệm về việc chỉ định đó. Quyền lợi…
DECLARE `A kind of payment` IS ONE OF
    `the temporary benefit`                    -- 3.1
    `the funeral benefit`                      -- 12.1
    `the death benefit`                        -- 12.2
    `the account value under Article 15`       -- 15
    `the maturity benefit`                     -- 13
    `the loyalty bonus`                        -- 14
    `a withdrawal`                             -- 21
    `a payment on early termination of a part` -- 22, 11.2(b)

-- 9.2: a change of Beneficiary.
-- src:511-516 | Việc thay đổi Người Thụ Hưởng của mỗi Người Được Bảo…
DECLARE `A change of Beneficiary` HAS
    `made in writing by the Insured Member personally` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the Company by Endorsement`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `consented to by the existing Beneficiaries`       IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 10.2 — a change of particulars`

-- src:554-558 | Nếu Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm/Người Được Bảo Hiểm thay đổi…
DECLARE `A kind of change of particulars` IS ONE OF
    `a change of residence`
    `a change of contact address`
    `a move abroad`
    `a change of full name`
    `a change of identity card`
    `a change of occupation`

DECLARE `A change of particulars` HAS
    `kind`                         IS A `A kind of change of particulars`
    `date of the change`           IS A DATE
    `date the Company was notified in writing` IS A MAYBE DATE

§§ `Article 11 — conversion or termination of one Insured Member's part`

-- src:610-620 | 11.2 Trường hợp Người Được Bảo Hiểm không còn đáp ứng…
DECLARE `A reason the person no longer qualifies` IS ONE OF
    `no longer meets the conditions of Article 1.4`
    `no longer meets the conditions agreed on the Contract Page`
    `at the request of the Policyholder`

DECLARE `A request to convert to an individual policy` HAS
    `filed on the Company's form`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `one periodic premium paid`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `debt paid`                                              IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Articles 12 to 15 — a death claim`

-- What the Company's file on a death holds. Amounts are VND.
-- `sum insured at the time of death` is the Sum Insured "đang áp dụng" (in force) at death,
-- before any 12.3 adjustment. The account value is the one at the date the Company received
-- the claim (12.2(ii)). The Article 15 flags are TRUE where the event causing death is
-- "directly related" to the act named.
-- src:717-727 | Nếu Người Được Bảo Hiểm tử vong trong thời gian Hợp…
-- src:657-658 | (ii) Giá Trị Tài Khoản tính đến ngày Công Ty nhận được…
-- src:678-690 | 12.4 Trước khi thanh toán Quyền lợi bảo hiểm tử vong như…
-- src:781-798 | Công ty sẽ không thanh toán Quyền lợi bảo hiểm tử vong theo…
DECLARE `A death claim` HAS
    `date of birth of the Insured Member`                   IS A DATE
    `date of death`                                         IS A DATE
    `date of the event causing death`                       IS A DATE
    `date the Company received the death claim`             IS A DATE
    `the Contract was in force at death`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `state of the part at death`                            IS A `A state of the part`
    `sum insured at the time of death`                      IS A NUMBER
    `account value on the date the claim was received`      IS A NUMBER
    `premium paid after the date of the death claim`        IS A NUMBER
    `funeral benefit already paid`                          IS A NUMBER
    `benefits arising after death already paid`             IS A NUMBER
    `debt`                                                  IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable costs incurred by the Company`              IS A NUMBER
    `suicide or a suicidal act, sane or insane`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `a criminal act of the Insured Member`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `a criminal act of the Policyholder`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `a criminal act of a Beneficiary`                       IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `The outcome of a death claim` IS ONE OF
    `the death benefit under Article 12, net under 12.4, of` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `only the account value under Article 15, of`            HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `no benefit: the part had lapsed or terminated`
    `no benefit: the part was suspended under Article 20`
    `no benefit: the Contract was not in force`

§§ `Article 14 — the loyalty bonus`

-- src:746-767 | 14.1 Vào Ngày Kỷ Niệm Năm thứ 05 (năm) và các Ngày Kỷ…
-- `account values at the last 60 Monthly Anniversaries` includes the one under review,
-- oldest first.
DECLARE `A loyalty bonus review` HAS
    `Policy Anniversary number`                                   IS A NUMBER
    `in force and never lapsed or suspended in the review period` IS A BOOLEAN
    `premium paid in full for every instalment in the review period` IS A BOOLEAN
    `any account value withdrawal in the review period`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `current sum insured`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `sum insured at the coverage start date`                      IS A NUMBER
    `account values at the last 60 Monthly Anniversaries`         IS A LIST OF NUMBER

§§ `Article 16 — a premium payment`

-- What the payment record shows. `instalment` is the Periodic Premium (1.12) where the
-- Policyholder has designated payment of rider premiums, and the Basic Premium otherwise.
-- src:813-832 | Nếu Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm không có chỉ định về việc đóng…
DECLARE `A premium payment` HAS
    `amount`                                                    IS A NUMBER
    `date paid`                                                 IS A DATE
    `Premium Due Date`                                          IS A DATE
    `insurance year`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `the Policyholder has designated payment of rider premiums` IS A BOOLEAN
    `all basic premium instalments due have been paid`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `instalment`                                                IS A NUMBER
    `instalments due and unpaid`                                IS A NUMBER
    `the Policyholder directed otherwise`                       IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `An allocation of a payment` HAS
    `instalments paid`             IS A NUMBER
    `applied to instalments`       IS A NUMBER
    `suspense premium`             IS A NUMBER
    `top-up premium`               IS A NUMBER

-- 16.2.1(a)(ii) and (b)(ii): what is on hand when the grace period ends.
-- src:838-850 | ii. Sau thời gian gia hạn đóng phí bảo hiểm, nếu…
-- src:868-897 | ii. Sau thời gian gia hạn đóng phí bảo hiểm, nếu các…
DECLARE `The position at the end of the grace period` HAS
    `insurance year`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `suspense premium`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `supplementary premium`                                     IS A NUMBER
    `account value available for withdrawal`                    IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium due and unpaid`                              IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium instalment`                                  IS A NUMBER
    `rider premium due and unpaid`                              IS A NUMBER
    `the Policyholder registered to pay rider premiums from the account value` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `What happens at the end of the grace period` HAS
    `all rider products cancelled`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `rider premium paid`                        IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium paid`                        IS A NUMBER
    `withdrawn from the account value`          IS A NUMBER
    `top-up premium`                            IS A NUMBER
    `left over, its use not stated`             IS A NUMBER
    `the part lapses`                           IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Where a payment goes, in order` IS ONE OF
    `the instalments due and unpaid`
    `the next instalment`
    `the Top-up Premium`
    `as the Policyholder directs`

DECLARE `When a payment was made` IS ONE OF
    `more than 15 days before the Premium Due Date`
    `within 15 days before the Premium Due Date`
    `on or after the Premium Due Date`

§§ `Article 18 — the grace period and lapse`

-- src:995-1005 | 18.1 Thời gian gia hạn đóng phí bảo hiểm là 60 (sáu mươi)…
-- src:1008-1022 | 18.2 Mất hiệu lực:…
DECLARE `The facts that start or end a grace period` HAS
    `insurance year`                                                   IS A NUMBER
    `first date the basic premium was not paid in full on its due date` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `first date the account value less Debt could not pay the Monthly Deduction` IS A MAYBE DATE

DECLARE `The position after the grace period` HAS
    `insurance year`                                                IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium still unpaid`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `account value enough to pay the basic premium`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `account value less Debt enough to pay the Monthly Deduction`   IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 19 — reinstatement`

-- src:1030-1051 | Bên Mua Bảo Hiểm và Người Được Bảo Hiểm có thể yêu cầu khôi…
DECLARE `A request for reinstatement` HAS
    `date the part lapsed`                                     IS A DATE
    `date of the request`                                      IS A DATE
    `maturity date`                                            IS A DATE
    `requested in writing by the Policyholder and the Insured Member` IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence of insurability accepted by the Company`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `one basic premium instalment`                             IS A NUMBER
    `Monthly Deductions in the grace period`                   IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium unpaid in the first three insurance years`  IS A NUMBER
    `debt`                                                     IS A NUMBER
    `amount paid with the request`                             IS A NUMBER

§§ `Article 20 — account suspension`

-- src:1058-1061 | 20.1 Bắt đầu từ Năm Bảo Hiểm thứ 4 (tư), tùy thuộc vào yêu…
-- src:1078-1086 | 20.3 Thời hạn tạm đóng sẽ theo thỏa thuận giữa Bên Mua…
DECLARE `A request for account suspension` HAS
    `insurance year`                             IS A NUMBER
    `requested by the Policyholder and the Insured Member` IS A BOOLEAN
    `suspensions already taken in the policy term` IS A NUMBER
    `requested start`                            IS A DATE
    `requested months`                           IS A NUMBER
    `maturity date`                              IS A DATE

§§ `Article 21 — a withdrawal from the Insured Member's account value`

-- src:1090-1104 | 21.1 Trong thời gian phần Hợp Đồng của Người Được Bảo…
DECLARE `A withdrawal request` HAS
    `insurance year`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `the part is in force`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `amount requested`                                         IS A NUMBER
    `withdrawal charge`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `debt`                                                     IS A NUMBER
    `the Insured Member's account value, excluding the vested account value` IS A NUMBER
    `the Company's minimum withdrawal at the time`             IS A NUMBER
    `the Company's minimum remaining balance at the time`      IS A NUMBER
    `plan`                                                     IS A `A Plan`
    `sum insured`                                              IS A NUMBER
    `account value after the withdrawal`                       IS A NUMBER
    `the Company's minimum sum insured`                        IS A NUMBER

§§ `Article 23 — a request to change the Sum Insured or the Plan`

-- src:1139-1165 | 23.1 Thay đổi Số Tiền Bảo Hiểm và/hoặc Kế Hoạch Bảo…
DECLARE `A kind of change of cover` IS ONE OF
    `an increase in the Sum Insured`
    `a decrease in the Sum Insured`
    `a change from the Basic Plan to the Enhanced Plan`
    `a change from the Enhanced Plan to the Basic Plan`

DECLARE `A request to change cover` HAS
    `kind`                                                     IS A `A kind of change of cover`
    `insurance year`                                           IS A NUMBER
    `the part is in force`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Insured Member consented`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `requested in writing on the Company's form`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence of insurability provided`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `sum insured after the change`                             IS A NUMBER
    `the product's minimum sum insured`                        IS A NUMBER
    `the product's maximum sum insured`                        IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium now`                                        IS A NUMBER
    `basic premium after the change`                           IS A NUMBER
    `the Policyholder pays the premium for the change`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `sum insured before the change`                            IS A NUMBER
    `account value at the request`                             IS A NUMBER
    `coverage start date`                                      IS A DATE
    `date the Company approved the change`                     IS A DATE

§§ `Articles 24 and 25 — one month of an account`

-- src:1255-1266 | 24.3 Giá Trị Tài Khoản…
-- The interest credited and the loyalty bonus for the month are inputs: the document gives a
-- floor on the annual rate (24.2(e)) but no rule for turning an annual rate into a month's
-- interest (NOTES.md fork F22).
DECLARE `A month of the account` HAS
    `account value of the previous month`        IS A NUMBER
    `premium allocated in the month`             IS A NUMBER
    `Monthly Deduction`                          IS A NUMBER
    `withdrawals in the month`                   IS A NUMBER
    `interest credited in the month`             IS A NUMBER
    `loyalty bonus in the month`                 IS A NUMBER
    `the account is suspended under Article 20`  IS A BOOLEAN

-- 25.2 and 25.3: a charge taken first from the Policyholder's account value (which includes
-- the vested account value) and then, for any shortfall, from the Insured Member's.
DECLARE `A charge taken from the accounts` HAS
    `from the Policyholder's account value`   IS A NUMBER
    `from the Insured Member's account value` IS A NUMBER
    `not covered by either account`           IS A NUMBER

§§ `Article 26 — a claim, its documents and its payment`

-- 26.1: notice of the insured event and its evidence, and whether a late notice was the
-- result of force majeure "under the law".
-- src:1363-1371 | Thông báo về sự kiện bảo hiểm xảy ra và các bằng…
DECLARE `A claim submission` HAS
    `date of the insured event`                         IS A DATE
    `date the notice and evidence were submitted`       IS A DATE
    `the delay was the result of force majeure`         IS A BOOLEAN

-- 26.3: when the file was complete, whether the Company approved the claim, and when it paid.
-- src:1394-1407 | 26.3 Thời gian giải quyết quyền lợi bảo hiểm…
DECLARE `A claim payment` HAS
    `date the Company received all the required documents` IS A DATE
    `the Company approved the claim`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `date the Company paid`                                IS A MAYBE DATE


-- src:1374-1393 | Trước khi thanh toán quyền lợi bảo hiểm, Công Ty phải…
DECLARE `The documents lodged with a death claim` HAS
    `completed claim form and authorisation`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `certified copy of the death certificate`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `medical records, if any`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `police accident record, for a death by accident, if any`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Certificate of Insurance`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `other documents the Company's website lists for the case`  IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Articles 28 and 29 — what ends a part, and what ends the Contract`

-- src:1426-1445 | Phần Hợp Đồng của Người Được Bảo Hiểm sẽ chấm dứt ngay khi…
DECLARE `An event that ends an Insured Member's part` IS ONE OF
    `the whole Contract terminated under Article 29.1`                 -- 28.1
    `the death of the Insured Member`                                  -- 28.2
    `a request by the Policyholder and the Insured Member to end the part early` -- 28.3
    `the Insured Member no longer meets Article 1.4 or the agreed conditions` -- 28.4
    `the Maturity Date of the part`                                    -- 28.5
    `a breach of law or of the Contract that leads to termination`     -- 28.6
    `another case the Contract or the Contract Page provides`          -- 28.7

-- src:1448-1469 | 29.1 Toàn bộ Hợp Đồng sẽ chấm dứt vào ngày có bất kỳ sự…
DECLARE `An event that ends the whole Contract` IS ONE OF
    `the Contract term ends, the Policyholder asks to end it, or every part has ended` -- (a)
    `the number of Insured Members falls below the agreed minimum`        -- (b)
    `the Policyholder is dissolved, bankrupt or closed by a state decision` -- (c)
    `the Policyholder ceases by division, merger or consolidation`        -- (d)
    `the Policyholder breaches the law or the Contract`                   -- (e)
    `another case the Contract, the Contract Page or the law provides`    -- (f)

-- 29.2(b): an organisation formed by the division, merger or consolidation.
-- src:1481-1500 | b) Đối với trường hợp chấm dứt theo Điều 29.1.(d):…
DECLARE `The New Organisation's position` HAS
    `evidence that it took over all the Policyholder's rights and obligations` IS A BOOLEAN
    `date on its establishment certificate or decision`                         IS A DATE
    `date it contacted the Company to become the Policyholder`                  IS A MAYBE DATE

DECLARE `What becomes of a part when the Contract ends` IS ONE OF
    `the Company will consider converting the part to an individual policy or ending it under Article 22`
    `the Company may consider converting the part to an individual policy or ending it under Article 22`
    `the New Organisation becomes the Policyholder`
    `the New Organisation is still within its 30 days`

§§ `The acts that the regulative rules speak of`

DECLARE `An act under the Contract` IS ONE OF
    `notify the Company in writing of the change`               -- 10.2
    `pay the basic premium due`                                 -- 16.4
    `pay the premium due within the grace period`               -- 18.1
    `submit notice of the insured event and its evidence`       -- 26.1
    `pay the death benefit`                                     -- 26.3(i)
    `pay the death benefit with interest for the delay`         -- 26.3(ii)
    `contact the Company to become the new Policyholder`        -- 29.2(b)
    `give written notice of the new charge`                     -- 25.2, 25.3(b), 25.6(b)
